This directory contains material from mlkem-libjade.

  Project:    mlkem-libjade, "ML-KEM implementation in libjade with high
              assurance", a project of the Post-Quantum Cryptography
              Alliance's PQ Code Package
  Repository: https://github.com/pq-code-package/mlkem-libjade
  Release:    v2025.12.1
  Commit:     c2380886a0d644266661e702d5000027df095a2b (2025-12-22)
  Licence:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (the file LICENSE in this
              directory, copied unmodified from the upstream repository)

The upstream repository names no copyright holder: its LICENSE is the
unmodified Apache-2.0 text and its source files carry no copyright or
licence header. The commits that add and update the ML-KEM sources are
authored by Tiago Oliveira and Manuel Barbosa. The repository's
MAINTAINERS.md lists Tiago Oliveira, Nigel Jones, Peter Schwabe, Manuel
Barbosa and Miguel Quaresma.

According to the upstream README, the Jasmin source was produced with the
Formosa Crypto tool-chain (https://formosa-crypto.org). The file
mlkem768_amd64_avx2.jazz is a single Jasmin unit printed by the Jasmin
compiler and contains Keccak code of Formosa Crypto's formosa-keccak.

The upstream repository contains no NOTICE file. This NOTICE was written for
the CatCrypt project; it adds attribution and does not modify the licence.
